  _id: 0
  _displayName: Mercenary
  _description: 'A free blade: a soldier of a disbanded army gone below for the coin.
    Loyal to no one, trusts no ossarite: plain steel, and ossarite is only pay.'
  _baseStats:
    Strength: 19
    Vitality: 19
    Spirit: 8
    Knowledge: 9
    Agility: 17
    Dexterity: 18
